t; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">]</span></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- (휴면 아이디 관리) 휴면 아이디는&nbsp;</span><b><u><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">재직 및 재적 상태 변경 날로부터 6개월(180일)</span></u></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;동안 사용하지 않으면 아이디가 휴면 처리된다. 휴면 처리 후 6개월</span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(180일)안에 정상 복구하지 않으면 아이디는 자동 삭제된다.&nbsp;</span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;붙임1. 금오공과대학교 웹메일 약관 개정 1부.</span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"margin-left: 34em;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2023.04</span></span></font></div><div style=\"margin-left: 34em;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></font></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
